	(text "5 V logic rail from VBAT_PROT (3S, 9.0-12.6 V). TPS54302: L 10 uH, Cout 3 x 22 uF (C307 added for DC-bias margin), FB 100k/13.7k -> 4.95 V nom, 4.74-5.16 V (1 %). WS2812B abs max 5.3 V limits the upper bound."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 55.88 0)
