		(uuid "fce9acc3-06aa-577f-81a9-33794777bba7")
	)
	(text "EN divider 69.8k/11.5k: on 8.65 V, off 8.04 V (logic stays on below the servo rail cut-off 8.8 V). R301 49.9 Ohm allows loop measurement. All parts are candidates (O-17)."
